---
import InnerPage from '../../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
---

<InnerPage
	title="Products"
	description="TeleTrex AI products for startups and SMBs: Relay for instant lead and customer answers, and more."
>
	<h1>Products</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		Everything here is built for real-world operations—fewer dropped conversations, less copy-paste, and
		answers that sound like your business.
	</p>

	<ul class="product-grid">
		<li>
			<a class="product-card" href="/products/associate">
				<h2 class="product-card__name">TeleTrex Associate</h2>
				<p class="product-card__tagline">Instant, on-brand answers for every prospect and client</p>
				<p class="product-card__desc">
					Your first and second line of support for handling questions and helping manage thier accounts and
          use your services. Prospects and clients get fast, friendly answers that keep them focussed and
          engaged in your offerings securely.  Build trust and instill confidence in realtime.
				</p>
				<span class="product-card__cta">Learn about TeleTrex Associate →</span>
			</a>
		</li>
    <!--
		<li>
			<a class="product-card" href="/products/community">
				<h2 class="product-card__name">TeleTrex Community</h2>
				<p class="product-card__tagline">Holistic integrated solution for community education, event and membership management, and growth automation</p>
				<p class="product-card__desc">
					Supportable Community creates order from chaotic management of multiple systems by integrating membership management, billing, event management, content development and distribution, and analytics into a holistic, integrated platform.  Works with Supportable Associate to provide the best online experience possible.
				</p>
				<span class="product-card__cta">Learn about TeleTrex Community →</span>
			</a>
		</li>
    -->
	</ul>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	.product-grid {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.product-card {
		display: block;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.04);
		text-decoration: none;
		color: inherit;
		transition:
			border-color 0.15s ease,
			box-shadow 0.15s ease;
	}

	.product-card:hover {
		border-color: var(--color-accent);
		box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.12);
	}

	.product-card__name {
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		color: var(--color-text);
	}

	.product-card__tagline {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.product-card__desc {
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
	}

	.product-card__cta {
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}
</style>
